{{rune header|Conqueror}}

== Notes ==
* '''Conqueror''' will grant stats based on the level of the user at the time of generating its first stack, even if more stacks are generated.{{bug|2}}
* Some {{tip|ranged}} {{tip|on-hit}} {{tip|basic damage|basic}} {{tip|ability damage}} will grant 2 stacks of ''Conqueror'' (i.e {{cai|W|Azir}}, {{cai|Q|Ezreal}}, {{cai|Q|Miss Fortune}}), others will grant only 1 (i.e {{cai|Q|Smolder}}, {{cai|Q|Vayne}}, {{cai|Q|Viktor}}), regardless of the damage belonging to an {{tip|ability}} {{tip|cast instance}}. {{bug|2}}
* '''Conqueror's''' stacking can only occur once per {{tip|cast instance}}.
** For example, the fire waves from {{cai|Divine Ascent|Kayle}} share the ''cast instance'' with its triggering basic attack. This means it can only trigger a stack of '''Conqueror''' once per attack instead of the expected twice.
** Abilities that apply a separate ''cast instance'' per hit will grant multiple stacks as normal.
** In addition, {{cai|Judgment|Garen}}, and {{cai|Cyclone|Wukong}} have been special cased to stack '''Conqueror''' for every tick of damage.
*** Other similar effects are not special cased (e.g {{cai|R|Nilah}}, {{cai|E|Pantheon}}, {{cai|R|Rakan}}, {{cai|Q|Taliyah}}, {{cai|R|Zac}}). {{bug|2}}
** While {{tip|basic damage}} {{tip|on-hit}} can stack multiple times regardless of ''cast instance'', {{cai|Q|Master Yi}} is the only multi {{tip|on-hit}} effect that doesn't do so for being a single cast instance and for not being {{tip|basic damage}}.
** If {{cai|Darkness Rise|Mordekaiser}} is activated through either {{ai|Obliterate|Mordekaiser}} or {{ai|Death's Grasp|Mordekaiser}}, it will be treated as the same ''cast instance'' as the triggering spell and it will not stack '''Conqueror'''.{{bug|2}}
* '''Conqueror''' will '''<u>not</u>''' stack or refresh from these specific effects.
** {{tip|Basic damage}} from {{tip|pet damage|pets}} (i.e. {{cis|Annie}} {{ui|Tibbers}} attack, {{cis|Malzahar}} {{ui|Voidling}} and {{cis|Yorick}} {{ui|Maiden of the Mist}} attack). {{bug|2|Was supposed to have been fixed in V9.7}}
*** {{uis|Daisy}} attacks apply {{cis|Ivern}} {{tip|on-hit}} effects, and therefore generate 1 stack of '''Conqueror''' per attack. {{bug|2|He would be expected to generate 2 stacks from the pet damage}}
** {{tip|Basic damage}} that does not trigger [[on-hit effects]] ({{cai|I|Nunu}} cone).
** Attacks done by {{tip|clone|clones}}, as they are accredited to the clone.
** {{iis|Runaan's Hurricane}} {{nie|Wind's Fury}} bolts, which are special cased to not stack '''Conqueror''' despite dealing {{tip|basic damage}} that can trigger on-hit effects (this includes special modifiers of Wind's Fury, such as on {{cais|Infernum|Aphelios}} cones, {{cai|Q|Ashe}} volleys, {{cai|Q|Jinx}} Fishbones attack).
** Attacks which are {{tip|dodged}} or missed while the user is {{tip|blind|blinded}}.
** Attacks against an {{tip|invulnerable}} target.
** The automatic basic attack following {{si|Dash}} if it already stacked '''Conqueror'''.{{bug|1|This was expected to have been fixed in V9.24}}
* '''Conqueror''' '''<u>will</u>''' stack or refresh for these specific effects.
** {{cais|W|Malphite}} cone effect, as the only AoE non-{{tip|spell damage|spell}} damage that isn't tagged as {{tip|proc damage}}.
** {{tip|default damage|Default}} / {{tip|raw damage}}
*** Including {{iis|The Collector}} {{nie|Death}} - although it shares a cast instance with the ability that triggered it, meaning it can only stack '''Conqueror''' if triggered by a damage over time effect at least 4 seconds after the effect's initial application.
** Attacks which are {{tip|blocked}}.

